---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import LinkBox from "../../components/ITserviceLinkBox.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="it-services-all">
    <div class="container">
        <LinkBox></LinkBox>
      <div class="text-container">
        <h3>IT OUTSOURCING</h3>
        <p>
          Whether on a part-time, full-time or project basis BIM ADVANCED
          TECHNOLOGY SERVICES can deliver experience and expertise on an
          outsourcing basis. This provides a more flexible, cost-effective
          solution than hiring a full-time network administrator.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our staff are experts at managing networks and computing platforms. We
          have experience in supporting all of the major technology platforms
          including Windows, Netware, routers, thin client and many more.
        </p>
        <p>
          BIM ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY SERVICES serves as the Virtual Business
          Technology Department and extension of the customer’s staff. BIM
          ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY SERVICES managers meet with customers on a regular
          basis and become an integral part of their technology planning. We
          attend company meetings, provide weekly status reports, train users,
          provide help desk services and manage budgets.
        </p>
        <p>
          The on-site network administrators are backed-up and supported by a
          highly expert team of advanced network engineers capable of solving
          any problem. This team can design and implement the most advanced
          technology solutions available. We even provide emergency weekend and
          after-hours service.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our flexible approach allows customers to add technical staffing as
          needed for special projects. BIM ADVANCED TECHNOLOGY SERVICES
          maintains a large staff of experienced network engineers to ensure a
          constant level of service.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/contact">CONTACT US</a>TODAY TO DISCUSS IT OUTSOURCING?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="img-container">
        <img src="/images/icons/meet.png" alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InnerLayout>
